    "The front sides are printing.\n\nWhen they are done, take the stack from the output tray and put it back into the paper tray so the blank sides get printed (usually: do not flip it, just move it).\n\nTip: try it once with 4 pages.\n\nContinue with the back sides?": {
      "en": "The front sides are printing.\n\nWhen they are done, take the stack from the output tray and put it back into the paper tray so the blank sides get printed (usually: do not flip it, just move it).\n\nTip: try it once with 4 pages.\n\nContinue with the back sides?",
      "de": "Die Vorderseiten werden gedruckt.\n\nWenn sie fertig sind, nimm den Stapel aus dem Ausgabefach und lege ihn wieder ins Papierfach, sodass die leeren Seiten bedruckt werden (meist: nicht umdrehen, einfach umlegen).\n\nTipp: Probier es einmal mit 4 Seiten aus.\n\nMit den Rückseiten fortfahren?",
      "tr": "Ön yüzler yazdırılıyor.\n\nBittiğinde desteyi çıkış tepsisinden alın ve boş yüzler yazdırılacak şekilde kâğıt tepsisine geri koyun (genellikle: çevirmeden, olduğu gibi taşıyın).\n\nİpucu: Bir kez 4 sayfayla deneyin.\n\nArka yüzlerle devam edilsin mi?"
    }
